{
  "vcon": "0.4.0",
  "uuid": "02b14bfa-011b-8c3a-861d-f074a8ddf782",
  "created_at": "2026-02-08T12:40:51-05:00",
  "subject": "Inbound call, Public Works",
  "parties": [
    {
      "name": "Ivan Semedo",
      "role": "resident",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    },
    {
      "name": "Lorraine Medeiros",
      "role": "clerk",
      "validation": "synthetic"
    }
  ],
  "dialog": [
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T12:36:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Public Works storm line, this is Lorraine."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T12:36:45-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah, hello. I know it's Sunday and City Hall's closed, that's why I'm calling this number. The storm line. Somebody told me this is the one that's open."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T12:36:56-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's right, this line is answered on weekends. What can I help you with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T12:37:02-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "The plow knocked over my mailbox. Knocked it right over. Post and all, it's laying in the snowbank."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T12:37:10-05:00",
      "duration": 6,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Oh, I'm sorry about that. The plow knocked over your mailbox, post and all."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T12:37:16-05:00",
      "duration": 15,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Post and all. And it's not even a real storm. We had a dusting, that's it, a dusting overnight. It's freezing cold out, been cold all week, but a dusting. And they come through like it's a blizzard."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T12:37:31-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Right, with the cold snap they've been salting and plowing even the light stuff so it doesn't turn to ice. Let me get some details. Can you give me the street you're on?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T12:37:44-05:00",
      "duration": 9,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Well, I'd rather not say the address on the phone. Can you just take it down as, as a mailbox report?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T12:37:53-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I do need a location for the crew to find it. Is there a cross street or a landmark you'd be comfortable with?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T12:38:03-05:00",
      "duration": 12,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "A landmark. Hm. Landmark. No, you know what, I'll just say it's on the island side, off the main road. You can pass that along and they'll figure it out."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T12:38:15-05:00",
      "duration": 18,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Off the main road on the island side. I'm afraid that's not enough for a crew to go on. I can note it and you can call back with the street whenever you like, or I can take your number and someone can reach you."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T12:38:33-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Take my number. It's 401-555-0154."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T12:38:36-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "401-555-0154. Got it. And your name?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T12:38:39-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Ivan Semedo. S-E-M-E-D-O."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T12:38:41-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Mr. Semedo, S-E-M-E-D-O. And the mailbox is knocked over, the post is down, in the snowbank. Is the mail still getting delivered, do you know?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T12:38:51-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Don't know. Haven't checked, it's Sunday. No mail Sunday. Which is another thing, I've got to dig it out of the bank tomorrow."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T12:39:01-05:00",
      "duration": 7,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fair enough. I'll put that in the note, that you'd like it looked at before Monday's mail."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T12:39:08-05:00",
      "duration": 5,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So when's it getting cleared? When's somebody coming to fix it?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T12:39:13-05:00",
      "duration": 14,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "When somebody's coming to fix it. Well, the post itself is something the damage claims side handles, and that's weekdays. Someone from Public Works should call you back Monday, probably in the morning or early afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T12:39:27-05:00",
      "duration": 3,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Monday. Morning or early afternoon."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T12:39:30-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That's the window I'd give you. If you can have the street ready when they call, it'll go quicker."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T12:39:38-05:00",
      "duration": 13,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Fine. I'll have it ready. I just don't see why it takes a phone call to the weekend line for a mailbox. Back when I was working you didn't have this."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T12:39:51-05:00",
      "duration": 8,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I understand. Do you want me to note anything about how the box looks, any photos you could take?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T12:39:59-05:00",
      "duration": 19,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I can take a picture. Picture of the post. I suppose. I was going to go down the waterfront anyway, sunny day, I take a long lunch down there when it's sunny. Cold as it is. Bench, the water, whatever. Then I'll come back and take the picture."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T12:40:18-05:00",
      "duration": 10,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "That sounds like a nice way to spend a sunny day. Take the picture when you're back and keep it handy for Monday."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T12:40:28-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Keep it handy. Okay."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T12:40:30-05:00",
      "duration": 11,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "So I have your name, your number, a mailbox and post knocked over by a plow after the overnight dusting, and a callback Monday. Anything else?"
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T12:40:41-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "No, that's it. Just get somebody to call."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T12:40:45-05:00",
      "duration": 4,
      "parties": [
        1
      ],
      "originator": 1,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "I will. Thanks for calling, Mr. Semedo. Stay warm."
    },
    {
      "type": "text",
      "start": "2026-02-08T12:40:49-05:00",
      "duration": 2,
      "parties": [
        0
      ],
      "originator": 0,
      "mediatype": "text/plain",
      "encoding": "none",
      "body": "Yeah. Bye."
    }
  ],
